{"vid":"xQY8m1a86is","source":"xQY8m1a86is.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.4,"txt":"I went from making $250,000 a year to now expecting"},{"t":5.3,"txt":"around $33,000 this year, and I'm so much happier now"},{"t":9.2,"txt":"than I was before."},{"t":10.7,"txt":"Damn, this is good."},{"t":13.6,"txt":"How do you take of the matcha matters?"},{"t":15.4,"txt":"The ratios of the matcha powder to water matters."},{"t":19,"txt":"How you whisk the matcha matters."},{"t":21.7,"txt":"I knew that every little thing would matter for the"},{"t":25.2,"txt":"success. And watch a house."},{"t":26.7,"txt":"There was like, very little room for error."},{"t":29,"txt":"So the first two months I only trusted myself to whisk"},{"t":33.4,"txt":"every drink. My entire life is worked now and I don't"},{"t":37.1,"txt":"regret it. My name is Michelle Young."},{"t":39.7,"txt":"I'm 29 years old and I earn about $33,000 a year living"},{"t":43.5,"txt":"in New York City. I grew up in"},{"t":52.4,"txt":"San Francisco."},{"t":53.8,"txt":"It was my single mom raising the rest of us,"},{"t":57.4,"txt":"um, in a neighborhood right next to Chinatown."},{"t":60.6,"txt":"Um, she's an immigrant, and she had to figure out"},{"t":65.3,"txt":"how to make ends meet."},{"t":67.5,"txt":"My family did a really good job in not making me feel"},{"t":70.8,"txt":"like we were poor, even though I was fully"},{"t":72.6,"txt":"aware we were."},{"t":74.5,"txt":"For example, I slept in the same bed as my mom"},{"t":78.6,"txt":"throughout my teenage years for as long as I could"},{"t":81.8,"txt":"remember. Financial stability was the ultimate"},{"t":84.8,"txt":"goal. My older brothers and I are."},{"t":88.1,"txt":"Mango is always like, we gotta get rich."},{"t":90.9,"txt":"Like, we gotta get to a point where we don't have to"},{"t":93.7,"txt":"worry about money again."},{"t":96,"txt":"My oldest brother, who is my idol,"},{"t":98.3,"txt":"he told me that software engineering is the next big"},{"t":101.7,"txt":"thing. So I decided to pursue it because I was good"},{"t":104.7,"txt":"enough at it, and I ended up going to"},{"t":107.7,"txt":"college for applied math and ended up a software"},{"t":110.1,"txt":"engineer. Going into my college dorm,"},{"t":112.6,"txt":"it was the first time I had my own space."},{"t":115.8,"txt":"And thinking back, it was the first time I had"},{"t":117.9,"txt":"my own closet, actually."},{"t":120,"txt":"So it was very like life changing."},{"t":122.6,"txt":"When I got my first offer as a software engineer."},{"t":125.2,"txt":"I was actually sitting on the toilet."},{"t":127.3,"txt":"Um, and I got the phone call and it was $160,000 and I"},{"t":132.9,"txt":"was actually in in shock."},{"t":135.6,"txt":"I started to realize the freedom I had with that"},{"t":139.1,"txt":"amount of money. I could travel anywhere,"},{"t":141.5,"txt":"anytime I wanted. I could buy almost anything I"},{"t":144.7,"txt":"wanted. If I enjoy something and I feel passionate about"},{"t":153.4,"txt":"it, I'll go all in."},{"t":155.5,"txt":"And if I start to lose sight of the purpose of it,"},{"t":159.7,"txt":"I'll just dial back and I just will be very"},{"t":162.3,"txt":"demotivated. And that's kind of what started to happen"},{"t":165.3,"txt":"towards the last few years of my career as a software"},{"t":168.7,"txt":"engineer. I realized pretty soon that I was doing it"},{"t":171.8,"txt":"because of the amount of money that I was providing"},{"t":174.9,"txt":"me, and the work itself just felt like it wasn't really"},{"t":178.7,"txt":"doing anything."},{"t":179.9,"txt":"It feels like fake work."},{"t":183,"txt":"And I realized the problem wasn't really the workplace"},{"t":186.5,"txt":"itself, because my teams were pretty decent."},{"t":189.4,"txt":"The culture at the company I worked at was pretty good"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"too, but by then I had already come up with this"},{"t":195.1,"txt":"idea to start something on my own and doing something"},{"t":198.4,"txt":"more physical. Around 2022 2023."},{"t":205.4,"txt":"I started to realize I needed to switch careers"},{"t":208.7,"txt":"completely, and I wasn't really sure what I was going"},{"t":211.8,"txt":"into, but I was pretty sure that the money part was not"},{"t":217.2,"txt":"always important to me anymore."},{"t":218.9,"txt":"I was saving, but I wasn't completely sure"},{"t":221.7,"txt":"what I was going to do next."},{"t":223.5,"txt":"Around 2024, my friends and I go out to get tea and we"},{"t":229.4,"txt":"try different matcha spots, and we just kind of realized"},{"t":232.6,"txt":"that there wasn't any good matcha places in New York."},{"t":235.9,"txt":"And I was making matcha at home for like years at that"},{"t":239,"txt":"point already. So I was like,"},{"t":240.8,"txt":"why is my own matcha better than the store bought ones?"},{"t":245.3,"txt":"I decided I really wanted to open a store in New York."},{"t":249.4,"txt":"I felt like New York really needed it."},{"t":251.1,"txt":"And so I started to do some calculations on my own just"},{"t":254.7,"txt":"to think about if it's feasible for me,"},{"t":256.8,"txt":"I saved up $200,000 cash savings to open up the cafe,"},{"t":262.7,"txt":"and that's what I felt like I needed."},{"t":264.5,"txt":"And it's actually a small amount for New York."},{"t":268,"txt":"A lot of places cost a lot more to open,"},{"t":270.5,"txt":"but I thought I could work with that."},{"t":273.3,"txt":"While I was still at my software engineering job."},{"t":276,"txt":"I worked from around 4:30 a.m."},{"t":279.6,"txt":"to 10 a.m. until my first meeting at my software"},{"t":283.3,"txt":"engineering job."},{"t":284.4,"txt":"It was hard, but it was very exciting."},{"t":286.6,"txt":"I was like, really fun for me."},{"t":288.1,"txt":"I loved working at Starbucks."},{"t":290.3,"txt":"It was so fun to like do something physical and like"},{"t":293.9,"txt":"just learn this completely new skill."},{"t":295.9,"txt":"When I've been sitting behind a computer for the"},{"t":297.9,"txt":"last five years, I think I was on my own"},{"t":300.8,"txt":"little mission and I had these own little tasks I"},{"t":303.5,"txt":"needed to complete before I'm able to open."},{"t":306.9,"txt":"And it's just this little training that I set up for"},{"t":309.9,"txt":"myself at Starbucks."},{"t":312.9,"txt":"We actually struggled to sign a lease on the first"},{"t":316.5,"txt":"three places I like because landlords didn't want to"},{"t":319.1,"txt":"trust a new business owner and also a small business."},{"t":322.4,"txt":"And then we had issues with our contractors."},{"t":326,"txt":"Some of our counters are still unfinished,"},{"t":328.5,"txt":"but they refuse to take accountability."},{"t":331.2,"txt":"And we still ended up having to pay them because I was"},{"t":333.5,"txt":"just on a time crunch to open the night before,"},{"t":337.4,"txt":"we were supposed to open our basement and our upstairs"},{"t":341,"txt":"flooded. We were having a friends and family"},{"t":343.3,"txt":"appreciation night. And behind the curtains,"},{"t":346,"txt":"there's just like flooding going on and we just had a"},{"t":349.8,"txt":"mop over it. I was too busy for anything except just"},{"t":352.9,"txt":"doing the next thing that had to be done."},{"t":359.2,"txt":"Nowadays, my expenses are just what's necessary,"},{"t":363.1,"txt":"so I spend most of my time here anyway."},{"t":366.6,"txt":"So I was really just eating and a place to go home to"},{"t":370.5,"txt":"sleep. I spend $1,750 on rent,"},{"t":377.3,"txt":"$258 on food, $112 on transportation,"},{"t":382.8,"txt":"$38 on utilities, $25 on subscriptions and"},{"t":387.7,"txt":"memberships, $15 on my phone bill,"},{"t":390.8,"txt":"$94 on other things."},{"t":394.7,"txt":"I had my own place, and it was a decent sized"},{"t":397.4,"txt":"studio in a very convenient location in Manhattan."},{"t":400.5,"txt":"But I knew I needed to give that kind of luxury up."},{"t":403.4,"txt":"So I took on a roommate, and now I live in a two"},{"t":408.1,"txt":"bedroom with a roommate in a location that's a little bit"},{"t":411.6,"txt":"further off. I miss that studio a lot."},{"t":415.2,"txt":"I loved living alone, but it's just like one of"},{"t":418.4,"txt":"the sacrifices I knew I needed to make."},{"t":421.3,"txt":"So obviously I was going to stop by and say hi."},{"t":423.4,"txt":"I know."},{"t":424.4,"txt":"My friends, I would not have been able to do any of it"},{"t":427.4,"txt":"without my friends."},{"t":428.7,"txt":"I started it alone."},{"t":430,"txt":"I didn't tell anyone about the idea for like the first"},{"t":433.9,"txt":"4 or 5 months, and by the time we started"},{"t":436.8,"txt":"getting these issues, I was like,"},{"t":438.6,"txt":"I, I need to actually ask for help."},{"t":441.3,"txt":"And my friends just came through."},{"t":443.5,"txt":"And then once it opened, all my friends and friends"},{"t":446.4,"txt":"of friends came through the support and lined up like"},{"t":449,"txt":"down the block. I think some of my friends waited two"},{"t":451.8,"txt":"hours. It was like the heat of the summer."},{"t":453.9,"txt":"I was just like in awe, like so speechless by the"},{"t":457.1,"txt":"support of my community."},{"t":458.6,"txt":"I would be working on bar from like 7 a.m."},{"t":462.3,"txt":"until like 6 p.m."},{"t":464.1,"txt":"or whatever, like just standing all day."},{"t":465.9,"txt":"And I didn't take any breaks either because I had to"},{"t":467.9,"txt":"whisk every drink."},{"t":469.1,"txt":"And my friends would come and bring me food."},{"t":471.7,"txt":"Following if you're ready."},{"t":476.4,"txt":"Do you have like vanilla or any like we have our house"},{"t":479.6,"txt":"sugar sirup."},{"t":481.2,"txt":"Now we've gone to the point where most of my employees"},{"t":483.9,"txt":"can run the shop without me."},{"t":485.8,"txt":"My typical day is mostly admin work."},{"t":488.4,"txt":"I schedule my staff to be able to manage the store"},{"t":490.8,"txt":"most days of the week, and then I'll work on bar on"},{"t":494.5,"txt":"a Saturday usually, and then maybe 1 to 3 other"},{"t":497.5,"txt":"days of the week."},{"t":498.8,"txt":"I work like just all hours."},{"t":500.7,"txt":"I'm awake. I guess I'm just always working,"},{"t":503.9,"txt":"um, as long as I can, except Sundays."},{"t":506.3,"txt":"I try to take one day of like complete rest."},{"t":509,"txt":"Software engineering."},{"t":510.2,"txt":"I worked Probably less than 40 hours a week."},{"t":514.4,"txt":"At the end of the day, I just feel happy about what"},{"t":517.5,"txt":"I've done in the day."},{"t":518.9,"txt":"I feel happy about the customers I've gotten to"},{"t":522.1,"txt":"interact with and make their days a little bit better."},{"t":525,"txt":"My life is less about like how much money I'm making"},{"t":527.7,"txt":"right now and more about like,"},{"t":529.1,"txt":"what I'm doing every day."},{"t":530.5,"txt":"When my life was about having a work life balance"},{"t":534.8,"txt":"and being able to do things outside of work,"},{"t":536.9,"txt":"I didn't feel like I was producing anything to the"},{"t":540.5,"txt":"world or making an impact in the world."},{"t":543.3,"txt":"Even though I was making money out of it,"},{"t":545.7,"txt":"I think now it's less about how much money I make from"},{"t":549.4,"txt":"my work, but what I'm actually doing from the day"},{"t":551.8,"txt":"to day with my work."},{"t":552.8,"txt":"So seeing the people that I'm impacting,"},{"t":556.2,"txt":"seeing the space I've created for people to build"},{"t":558.9,"txt":"community here, that gives me so much more"},{"t":562.2,"txt":"meaning and purpose at the end of each day."}],"words":[{"t":0.36,"w":"I"},{"t":0.36,"w":"went"},{"t":0.36,"w":"from"},{"t":0.36,"w":"making"},{"t":0.36,"w":"$250,000"},{"t":0.36,"w":"a"},{"t":0.36,"w":"year"},{"t":0.36,"w":"to"},{"t":0.36,"w":"now"},{"t":0.36,"w":"expecting"},{"t":5.28,"w":"around"},{"t":5.28,"w":"$33,000"},{"t":5.28,"w":"this"},{"t":5.28,"